 Kinkaku-ji's gold leaf sheen.\nA shimmering temple a glorious scene.\nAnd wander through Nishiki Market's maze.\nWhere culinary delights forever amaze.\n\n**Day Six: Nara Deer and Todai-ji**\n\nJourney to Nara where deer roam free.\nA friendly greeting for thee and for me.\nVisit Todai-ji Temple a sight to see.\nWith a giant Buddha for eternity.\nExplore Kasuga Taisha with lanterns bright.\nA pathway glowing in the fading light.\nThen return to Kyoto with heart so full.\nA journey complete a wondrous pull.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure**\n\nFarewell dear traveler thy journey ends.\nTo lands afar thy spirit transcends.\nCarry with thee memories that never bend.\nOf Japan's beauty a friendship to lend.\nMay fortune smile upon thee evermore.\nAnd open paths to lands to explore.\nReturn again to this magical place.\nAnd find delight in time's sweet embrace.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0029929152224212885}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3351351299206726e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.516659677028656}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.009209651499986649}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.16942277550697327}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.052428126335144}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -0.4418279528617859}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.00015686711412854493}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.014928764663636684}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -0.1346064805984497}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -0.00010895135346800089}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.19080637395381927}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.1299317628145218}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.08824119716882706}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.4641544222831726}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -1.8139694929122925}, {"token": "▁awaits", "logprob": -0.13810499012470245}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.042210303246974945}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.5329145193099976}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.3056933879852295}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.0011853104224428535}, {"token